Search by meaning downloads, on the user's request, the text model of
EmbeddingGemma 2 by Google (https://huggingface.co/google/embeddinggemma-2),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0, in the ONNX export published by
onnx-community (https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/embeddinggemma-2-ONNX).
Deployments must adhere to the Gemma Prohibited Use Policy:
https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy

Search by meaning runs that model with ONNX Runtime (onnxruntime-node,
Copyright Microsoft Corporation, MIT License), tokenizes with
@huggingface/tokenizers (Apache License 2.0), and stores chat vectors with
sqlite-vec by Alex Garcia (MIT License or Apache License 2.0).
